## Isolation and truthful-tool execution gate\r\n- Copies of the **student-approved, outcome-only product inputs** may be placed on this branch; do NOT copy Vibe code, tests, SQL, UI layout, screenshots, scripts or retrospective evidence.\r\n- Actual official GitHub Spec Kit initialization must be shown by real `specify version` / `specify init` output and generated project files; a connector-authored document alone is NOT a completed official Spec Kit run.\r\n- Constitution and subsequent `/speckit-*` actions run inside a *supported coding agent*, not as shell commands; retain authentic transcripts and student review.\r\n- No cloud migrations, production deployments or live Auth provider settings are approved by this research-only instruction.\r\n","Path":"docs/sdd-input/SDD_002_VERBATIM_APPROVAL_BEFORE_SPECKIT_2026-10-30.md"}
